Usage: android sdk install [-h] [--beta] [--canary] [--force]
                           <package>[@<version>]
Install SDK packages

Options:
      --beta            Include beta packages
      --canary          Include canary packages
      --force           Force downgrading to an older version
  -h, --help            Show this help message and exit.

sdk options:
      --platform=PARAM  Target platform <os>_<arch> (e.g. linux_x86_64,
                        mac_arm64, windows_x86), defaults to current host

android options:
      --sdk=PARAM       Path to the Android SDK
  -v, --verbose         Enable verbose output for troubleshooting
  -V, --version         Print version information and exit.

Positional Parameters:
  <package>[@<version>]  The packages to install, <version> defaults to latest
